  "src": "solid even-sized gray rectangles, each surrounded by four diagonal colored marker pixels",
  "transform": "erase the markers; split each gray rectangle into four equal quadrants and recolor them from the corresponding top-left, top-right, bottom-left, and bottom-right marker colors",
  "symbol_instructions": "the four diagonal corner markers are a local quadrant-color legend for the gray rectangle they surround"
}
</annotation>
